- How would you extend to multiple producers/consumers?
- How would you detect and recover from stack/memory ordering mistakes?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical lock design for multi-socket systems, balancing scalability and correctness under contention.

## Key Concepts

- MCS locks and queue-based synchronization
